OL,5,G0232 Health Check
OL,6,     FThree months since the outbreak
OL,7,     Fwas declared more than 1,900
OL,8,     Fpeople have died from the virus,
OL,9,     Fwith more than 4200 confirmed
OL,10,     Fcases, making this the
OL,11,     Fsecond-worst Ebola outbreak ever.
